 "body": {
  "summary": "The day Krishna lifted Govardhan and its glory was sung.",
  "why": [
   {
    "text": "Pulastya brings Govardhan to Vrindavana, where Sananda's curse shrinks him.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Garga Samhita, Vrindavana-khanda",
    "ref": "Garga 2.2",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=25073&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "Govardhan's clear story takes away great sins.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Garga Samhita, Vrindavana-khanda",
    "ref": "Garga 2.2",
    "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=25073&prop=wikitext&format=json"
   },
   {
    "text": "Indra floods Vraja in anger, and Krishna lifts the hill one-handed for seven days.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhagavata Purana",
    "ref": "Bhagavata 10.25",
    "source_url": "https://vedabase.io/en/library/sb/10/25/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Indra withdraws, Krishna sets the hill back, and the gods rain flowers.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhagavata Purana",
    "ref": "Bhagavata 10.25",
    "source_url": "https://vedabase.io/en/library/sb/10/25/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Vishnu protects the good and destroys the wicked, age after age.",
    "basis": "text",
    "text_name": "Bhagavad Gita",
    "ref": "Gita 4.8",
    "source_url": "shlokas row 7e54ccbca104496d"
   }
  ],
  "do": {
   "gather": [],
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Remember Krishna holding the hill over Vraja for seven days.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Bhagavata Purana",
     "ref": "Bhagavata 10.25",
     "source_url": "https://vedabase.io/en/library/sb/10/25/"
    },
    {
     "text": "Bow to Govardhan and walk around it.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Garga Samhita, Vrindavana-khanda",
     "ref": "Garga 2.2",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=25073&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    },
    {
     "text": "Offer worship for the protection of the good.",
     "basis": "text",
     "text_name": "Bhagavad Gita",
     "ref": "Gita 4.8",
     "source_url": "shlokas row 7e54ccbca104496d"
    }
   ],
   "budget": [
    {
     "text": "Reuse a clean cloth and the deity's picture already at home.",
     "basis": "custom",
     "region": "family",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=25073&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    },
    {
     "text": "Set aside water and a small seasonal offering from what you have.",
     "basis": "custom",
     "region": "family",
     "source_url": "https://sa.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=parse&pageid=25073&prop=wikitext&format=json"
    },
    {
     "text": "Keep the observance simple: prayer and attention, with any lamp placed safely.",
     "basis": "custom",
     "region": "family",
